  "title": "Millimeter-Wave Network Clusters For Autonomous Digital Infrastructure",
  "summary": "Peraso Inc. and Virewirx, Inc. collaborated to develop and demonstrate a millimeter-wave wireless network cluster capable of achieving a 50Gbps peak aggregate data capacity. This integration of specialized semiconductor hardware and network control software targets autonomous systems, such as drone swarms and automated industrial vehicles, operating in congested spatial environments.",
